    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif geneatmanna hwylc forgymeleasað his hlafordes gafol ⁊ hit him to ðæm rihtandagan ne gelæst, wen is, gyf se hlaford mildheort bið, þæt he ða gymeleaste to forgyfenesse læte ⁊ to his gafole buton witnunge fó.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If any tenant neglects the payment due to his lord and does not render it to him on the appointed day, it is to be expected that, if the lord is merciful, he will grant forgiveness for the neglect and take his payment without exacting a penalty.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif geneatmanna hwylc forgymeleasað his hlafordes gafol ⁊ hit him to ðæm rihtandagan ne gelæst, wen is, gif se hlaford mildheort bið, þæt he ða gymeleaste to forgyfnesse læte ⁊ to his gafole buton witnunge fó;</ab>
      </div>
